Jie Zi calienta cuartos ocultos.')); ?></p><p><strong><?php echo s($warmphlegmtext('Color → location → direction → processing.','Color → localización → dirección → procesamiento.')); ?></strong></p></aside><p class="single-herbs-guide__scope-note"><strong><?php echo s($warmphlegmtext('Current guideline:','Guía vigente:')); ?></strong> <?php echo s($warmphlegmtext('five module herbs appear in Appendix A. Dan Nan Xing remains for module recognition and is marked outside the current list.','cinco hierbas del módulo aparecen en Appendix A. Dan Nan Xing permanece para reconocimiento y está marcada fuera del listado vigente.')); ?></p><ol class="single-herbs-guide__category-herbs"><?php foreach($warmphlegmherbs as $herb): ?><li class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb<?php echo $herb['official']?' single-herbs-guide__category-herb--core':''; ?>"><div class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb-head"><strong><?php echo s($herb['name']); ?></strong><em><?php echo s($herb['latin']); ?></em><span class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb-badge<?php echo $herb['official']?'':' single-herbs-guide__category-herb-badge--outside'; ?>"><?php echo s($herb['official']?$warmphlegmtext('Module + current Appendix A','Módulo + Appendix A vigente'):$warmphlegmtext('Module only · outside current Appendix A','Solo módulo · fuera del Appendix A vigente')); ?></span></div><p><?php echo s($herb['identity']); ?></p></li><?php endforeach; ?></ol></section>
